#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:1
msgid "E4219"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_export_name`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`invalid_export_name`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:5
msgid ""
"The `#export_name` attribute is invalid. Export names must be unique "
"within the package. Name restrictions depend on the backend: native "
"requires valid C symbol identifiers, while WebAssembly export names are "
"UTF-8 strings and are not limited to C identifiers."
msgstr "`#export_name` 属性无效。导出名称在包内必须唯一。名称限制取决于后端：native 要求名称是合法的 C 符号标识符，而 WebAssembly 的导出名称是 UTF-8 字符串，不受 C 标识符规则限制。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:9
msgid ""
"The attribute may be used only on public, non-generic function "
"definitions without optional arguments in a foreign-library package."
msgstr "该属性只能用于外部库包中没有可选参数的公开非泛型函数定义。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:14
msgid "Both functions use the export name `add_one`, which must be unique:"
msgstr "两个函数都使用了导出名称 `add_one`，但该名称必须唯一："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:16
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"add_one\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"add_one\")\n"
"pub fn add_two(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 2\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:20
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:22
msgid "Give each function a distinct export name:"
msgstr "为每个函数指定不同的导出名称："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4219.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"add_one\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"#export_name(\"add_two\")\n"
"pub fn add_two(value : Int32) -> Int32 {\n"
"  value + 2\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
